//! The Keel standard library.
//!
//! Each module is imported by name through the package, `import kl::list;`, and its declarations
//! are written through the package too, `kl::list<i32>`.
//!
//! - `list`: `list<T>`, a growable array.
//! - `string`: `string`, a growable sequence of bytes, and `parse_error`.
//! - `optional`: `optional<T>`, a value or nothing, and the functions that take one apart.
//! - `pair`: `pair<A, B>`, two values held together.
